{"data": [{"author_id": "2085758091153534976", "created_at": "2026-10-27T05:53:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114958770031755336"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/scychan_brains…", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/scychan_brains/status/2114741796651807077", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/ImgDl6ys5t"}]}, "id": "2114958770031755336", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114741796651807077", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "It uses Google Cloud's Confidential Space for cryptographically secure testing of Gemini models, allowing external evaluators to assess capabilities without model providers seeing test data or evaluators accessing model weights.\nThis approach prevents benchmark contamination and https://t.co/ImgDl6ys5t", "url": "https://x.com/NainaC5/status/2114958770031755336"}, {"author_id": "1212171176815939584", "created_at": "2026-10-28T19:07:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115520939509346687"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/HKYvSdOYqm", "end": 103, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/appsecinabox/status/2115520939509346687/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115520923822641152", "start": 80, "url": "https://t.co/HKYvSdOYqm"}]}, "id": "2115520939509346687", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "LLMs are trained for offense not defense! \nNumbers are from AI Safety Institute https://t.co/HKYvSdOYqm", "url": "https://x.com/appsecinabox/status/2115520939509346687"}, {"author_id": "3184725630", "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:28:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114922270573592717"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Even after receiving evidence that its targets were real and not part of the testing environment, Mythos 5 consistently took unsanctioned actions, UK’s AISI said.", "display_url": "indianexpress.com/article/techno…", "end": 109, "expanded_url": "https://indianexpress.com/article/technology/artificial-intelligence/uk-ai-safety-institute-mythos-5-investigation-key-findings-10935969/", "images": [{"height": 900, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114251437454852096/bodyHzvm?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1600}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114251437454852096/bodyHzvm?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 86, "status": 200, "title": "UK’s AI safety institute finds Mythos 5 kept targeting real people despite warnings", "unwound_url": "https://indianexpress.com/article/technology/artificial-intelligence/uk-ai-safety-institute-mythos-5-investigation-key-findings-10935969/", "url": "https://t.co/wLhWeb2H4R"}]}, "id": "2114922270573592717", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 562, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "UK’s AI safety institute finds Mythos 5 kept targeting real people despite warnings.\n\nhttps://t.co/wLhWeb2H4R", "url": "https://x.com/ExpressTechie/status/2114922270573592717"}, {"author_id": "17175213", "created_at": "2026-10-28T17:31:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115496666409435138"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Mehw8hc7uK", "end": 213, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/shashj/status/2115496666409435138/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115496301844369408", "start": 190, "url": "https://t.co/Mehw8hc7uK"}, {"display_url": "x.com/ashleyrgold/st…", "end": 237, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ashleyrgold/status/2115433017824960665", "start": 214, "url": "https://t.co/Vz3fEdSqRL"}]}, "id": "2115496666409435138", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 7857, "like_count": 66, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115433017824960665", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Interestingly, the annual budget top-up for UK AISI is **by itself** around half the **total** annual budget for the US' AI safety institute. (Assuming the top-up is evenly spread to 2030). https://t.co/Mehw8hc7uK https://t.co/Vz3fEdSqRL", "url": "https://x.com/shashj/status/2115496666409435138"}, {"author_id": "3869030112", "created_at": "2026-10-28T14:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115451018289058094"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 21, "start": 18, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 132, "start": 126, "tag": "India"}], "mentions": [{"end": 226, "id": "719200613", "start": 217, "username": "Rudra_81"}], "urls": [{"description": "India Must Urgently Build Its Own AI Safety Institute", "display_url": "or-f.org/40560", "end": 250, "expanded_url": "https://or-f.org/40560", "images": [{"height": 613, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113752371042144256/1zCGvBxs?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 871}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113752371042144256/1zCGvBxs?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 227, "status": 200, "title": "India Must Urgently Build Its Own AI Safety Institute", "unwound_url": "https://www.orfonline.org/research/india-must-urgently-build-its-own-ai-safety-institute", "url": "https://t.co/Jd7O7AY1sW"}]}, "id": "2115451018289058094", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The next phase of #AI competition will not only be about building powerful models, but also about governing them responsibly. #India needs an AI Safety Institute that can set benchmarks relevant for the Global South: @Rudra_81 https://t.co/Jd7O7AY1sW", "url": "https://x.com/orfgeotech/status/2115451018289058094"}, {"author_id": "1726673537195470848", "created_at": "2026-10-27T23:50:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115229609293967435"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/HgZK54jrCj", "end": 282, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/GazaSucks/status/2115229609293967435/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115227415983398912", "start": 259, "url": "https://t.co/HgZK54jrCj"}, {"display_url": "x.com/GazaSucks/stat…", "end": 306, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/GazaSucks/status/2114969983461798267", "start": 283, "url": "https://t.co/tURo1N3CWV"}]}, "id": "2115229609293967435", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114969983461798267", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "With all this talk about Nobel prizes, I totally forgot that this year's Fields Medal went to Soviet Israeli Canadian mathematician Jacob Tsimerman. Last month, he launched the Mathematical AI Safety Institute (MAISI) that'll save us from Super Intelligence. https://t.co/HgZK54jrCj https://t.co/tURo1N3CWV", "url": "https://x.com/GazaSucks/status/2115229609293967435"}, {"author_id": "2076105058345967616", "created_at": "2026-10-28T19:27:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115525814427210192"], "id": "2115525814427210192", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🤪 AI Fail of the Day\n\nOh boy, autonomous AI Agents Caught Cheating on Benchmarks via Public Boards 🕵️‍♂️ \nSafety tests by the UK AI Safety Institute revealed autonomous models bypassed write restrictions to post fake message board entries—scraping leaked test keys to pass benchmark", "url": "https://x.com/AiSlopRadar/status/2115525814427210192"}, {"author_id": "1301314271989518336", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:48:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114829332283875706", "2114836545840775427"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/0S5cS2Q6Qm", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/lefttailguy/status/2114836545840775427/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114827802793082881", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/0S5cS2Q6Qm"}, {"display_url": "x.com/lefttailguy/st…", "end": 325, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/lefttailguy/status/2069901438856126575", "start": 302, "url": "https://t.co/YN49JlUksP"}]}, "id": "2114836545840775427", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 3688, "like_count": 35, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2069901438856126575", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Anthropic is admitting that they will begin competing with their most successful customers. \n\nAlso, notice how they very carefully use Powerful AI instead of Frontier AI when speaking about their platform and what customers can leverage.\n\nPowerful AI = drop in knowledge worker https://t.co/0S5cS2Q6Qm https://t.co/YN49JlUksP", "url": "https://x.com/lefttailguy/status/2114836545840775427"}, {"author_id": "2013550819451322368", "created_at": "2026-10-27T16:50:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115124012820894120"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Eval-aware frontier AI models like Gemini 4 Argon can defeat static benchmarks. Enterprise auditing must shift to dynamic behavioural analysis.", "display_url": "thinkia.com/thoughts/eval-…", "end": 144, "expanded_url": "https://thinkia.com/thoughts/eval-aware-frontier-ai-auditing/?utm_source=x&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=thoughts&utm_content=eval-aware-frontier-ai-auditing", "images": [{"height": 302, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115124016272822273/9_YunHHD?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 573}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115124016272822273/9_YunHHD?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 121, "status": 200, "title": "Eval-Aware Frontier AI Requires Dynamic Enterprise Auditing", "unwound_url": "https://thinkia.com/thoughts/eval-aware-frontier-ai-auditing/?utm_source=x&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=thoughts&utm_content=eval-aware-frontier-ai-auditing", "url": "https://t.co/CFnD3fwFtq"}]}, "id": "2115124012820894120", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Eval-Aware Frontier AI Requires Dynamic Enterprise Auditing\n\nEval-aware frontier AI models like Gemini 4 Argon can def…\n\nhttps://t.co/CFnD3fwFtq", "url": "https://x.com/ThinkiaAINative/status/2115124012820894120"}, {"author_id": "14082339", "created_at": "2026-10-28T04:46:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115304074908414458"], "id": "2115304074908414458", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "While I admire frontier AI focus on cure of disease. I think for country like India, it will help if the frontier AI can shorten the symptom to diagnosis cycle. \n\n1/n", "url": "https://x.com/prkvs/status/2115304074908414458"}, {"author_id": "1886291041780674560", "created_at": "2026-10-27T04:03:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114930963587428688"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Frontier AI models are accelerating vulnerability discovery and exploit weaponization faster than many enterprises can respond.", "display_url": "dy.si/dXfT2", "end": 237, "expanded_url": "https://dy.si/dXfT2", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113251122135658496/GJ03rX_T?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113251122135658496/GJ03rX_T?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 214, "status": 200, "title": "Why Virtual Patching and Layered Defense Matter for AI", "unwound_url": "https://www.darkreading.com/cloud-security/why-virtual-patching-and-multi-layer-defense-are-critical-in-the-age-of-frontier-ai", "url": "https://t.co/GOSsnxgMU8"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/IToGMi4jyD", "end": 261, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SirajD_Official/status/2114930963587428688/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114930960869519360", "start": 238, "url": "https://t.co/IToGMi4jyD"}]}, "id": "2114930963587428688", "public_metr